	<brief_description>
		The driver's master controller of a vehicle.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		The positions of the main and second controller and how fast they step - the controller part of the FIZ [code]Cntrl.[/code] section. Every vehicle with that section has one, with an engine or without: a control car reverses and steps its own controller.
	</description>
